# Line endings (CRLF)

All **text** sources under `org.jrebirth.af` must use Windows-style line endings: **CRLF** (`\r\n`), not LF alone.

- When creating or editing files, save with CRLF.
- Do not convert binary assets (images, fonts, jars, compiled classes).
- `org.jrebirth.af/.gitattributes` enforces `eol=crlf` for Git checkouts on this tree.

If a file shows as changed only for line endings, normalize to CRLF rather than reverting to LF.
